I got two responses from DEC folk mostly reminding me that OSF/1 1.3 is
from the Alpha Dark Ages and not supported by DEC anymore :-). What is
probably the definitive answer came from Martin Moore
(martin@jerry.alf.dec.com) who said:

>No, there isn't a 1.3 patch.  We don't support 1.x anymore.  But as long
>as you do not actually change the date on these systems anytime from 2/29
>through 3/31/96, you shouldn't have a problem.

