1.
Alexandru PANOIU, Alan Oborne, Herve DEMARTHE suggested:

The fix is to copy /usr/share/lib/term/tablp to 
/usr/share/lib/term/tablp.save
then copy /usr/share/lib/term/tablpr to /usr/share/lib/term/tablp
-------
It works!

2.
Paul E. Rockwell, Sam Sarasin wrote:

Known problem fixed by the following patch for 2.0, and fixed
in DEC OSF/1 2.1 and later:
=======================
/usr/bin/nroff                  (USG-00376)
CHECKSUM: 00359   279
---------------------

Patch id:       OSFV20-032-1                    (included in V2.1)

This patch corrects the problem of a core dump being produced when the
the command "nroff -man filename" is executed.


note: nroff -man is what gets executed by the man command...
