From: Dougal Scott <dwagon@aaii.oz.au>

The usual problem with scripts such as this, is they get sent signals
which cause them to die. Try trapping signals in the script and seeing
if it gets further.

---
From: Juergen Bock <FDV20_24@dbf-s1.dbf.ddb.de>

try nohup iostat ...

