Hi,

I'm looking for the best way to set up NSR on an Alpha 2000 4/233 running DU 3.2C.
We have about 10 systems to backup. 4GB of disk each, of which 1GB for the home-directories.

The server has a DAT Jukebox with 4 TLZ07 (capacity 8GB compressed per drive).

For the moment I am running DecNSR version 2 on an old Ultrix 2100 server with 4 TLZ06.
The server settings are: parallelism = 4; active devices = 1; sessions per device = 4.
We have 10 Ultrix clients. For each client we do a full backup once a month, the rest of the 
